    {
      "id": "slide_09_rules",
      "rank": 9,
      "layout": "smart-grid",
      "theme": "cyber",
      "parameters": {
        "vibe": "minimal",
        "cols": 2
      },
      "widgets": {
        "cell1": {
          "type": "Type.Body",
          "parameters": {
            "text": "✅ **Do's**\n\n- Teams of 1-4 people\n- Start coding after kickoff\n- Use any language/framework\n- Build something new\n- Have fun & help others!"
          }
        },
        "cell2": {
          "type": "Type.Body",
          "parameters": {
            "text": "❌ **Don'ts**\n\n- No pre-written code\n- No existing projects\n- Don't work with > 4 people\n- Don't be a jerk\n- Don't forget to sleep (a little)"
          }
        },
        "cell3": {
          "type": "Type.Body",
          "parameters": {
            "text": "📝 **Submission Requirements**\n\n- GitHub repo (public)\n- 2-minute demo video\n- README with setup instructions\n- Deploy to public URL if possible"
          }
        },
        "cell4": {
          "type": "Type.Body",
          "parameters": {
            "text": "⚠️ **Code of Conduct**\n\n- Respect everyone\n- Inclusive environment\n- Report issues to organizers\n- MLH Code of Conduct applies"
          }
        }
      },
